# MIFARE Classic default keys (public dictionary, leading slice)
#
# Source (real, public): the community "iceman" default-keys dictionary shipped
# with the Proxmark3 project and mirrored across libnfc and Flipper Zero.
#   https://github.com/RfidResearchGroup/proxmark3/blob/master/client/dictionaries/mfc_default_keys.dic
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhovner/proxmark3-1/master/client/default_keys.dic
#
# These are FACTORY / TRANSPORT / APPLICATION defaults, published for years and
# used here ONLY so PhantomTap can DETECT deployments still running on known
# keys. No site-specific or non-public key material appears in this repository.
#
# One 12-hex-char key (6 bytes) per line. '#' lines are comments.
